# An attribute of a copy refers to another attribute of the copy, via ξ.
#
#   ⟦ a ↦ ⟦ x ↦ ξ.y, y ↦ ∅ ⟧, foo ↦ Φ.a(y ↦ ⟦ Δ ⤍ 00-00-00-00-00-00-00-2A ⟧).x ⟧
#
# The script below is printed by `phino sodg` 0.0.167.

F c0 a foo
F c1 x y
D c2 c1 y
P c1 x c2
P c0 a c1
D c3 c0 a
F c4
Δ c4 00-00-00-00-00-00-00-2A
A c5 c3 y c4
D c6 c5 x
P c0 foo c6
